ing user ID logic**\\n\\nI'm thinking about the need for a telegram user ID logic, which probably isn't related to webchat. I might need to inspect the script for how it handles things. Also, there's a local image path to consider, and I may have saved the image in an inbound folder. I'll need the latest image for whatever task I'm working on. Plus, I want to check if I need a user ID that feels arbitrary. So, let's inspect the script!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"I’m running the dedicated kidney imaging pipeline on the CT image you uploaded, then I’ll summarize the key detector and analyzer outputs in plain language.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_05d97e88d5148a470169b91fbf30088191a94cf2cd83481aaf\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_DYuCI4G0srUmZqa4q1T3yzwm|fc_05d97e88d5148a470169b91fbf3c148191b9eb892b0d6576b8","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"~/.openclaw/skills/kidney-pipeline-execution/scripts/pipeline_execution_tool.py"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"~/.openclaw/skills/kidney-pipeline-execution/scripts/pipeline_execution_tool.py\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1753,"output":130,"cacheRead":37248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39131,"cost":{"input":0.0043825,"output":0.0019500000000000001,"cacheRead":0.009311999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0156445}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773739960947}}
